---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-1" rowSpan="md:row-span-6" title="About me">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <div class="text-sm font-light">
      <p>
        Hi, I’m Kaustav Bhattacharya, a student at the University of
        Wisconsin–Madison studying Aerospace Engineering with a mechanical
        focus. I like working on design driven problems where strong
        fundamentals meet practical execution.
        <br />
        My primary tools of choice includes:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
        <li>SolidWorks</li>
        <li>Fusion 360</li>
        <li>Onshape</li>
        <li>MATLAB</li>
        <li>Simulink</li>
        <li>ANSYS (Mechanical)</li>
        <li>Python</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      Beyond coursework, I’m passionate about music and building projects
      outside the classroom, from designing mechanisms to iterating on real
      prototypes. I enjoy taking a project from concept to build and learning
      whatever tools are needed along the way.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      While I have preferred tools, I always choose what best fits the problem
      and constraints. My goal is to find the simplest, most reliable solution
      for each project.
    </p>
  </div>
</Card>
